          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(3\\cos\\theta+4\\sin\\theta)^2+(4\\cos\\theta-3\\sin\\theta)^2&=\\begin{aligned}&9\\cos^2\\theta+24\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+16\\sin^2\\theta\\\\&+16\\cos^2\\theta-24\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta+9\\sin^2\\theta\\end{aligned}\\\\(3\\cos\\theta+4\\sin\\theta)^2+(4\\cos\\theta-3\\sin\\theta)^2&=25\\cos^2\\theta+25\\sin^2\\theta\\\\(3\\cos\\theta+4\\sin\\theta)^2+(4\\cos\\theta-3\\sin\\theta)^2&=25(\\cos^2\\theta+\\sin^2\\theta)\\\\(3\\cos\\theta+4\\sin\\theta)^2+(4\\cos\\theta-3\\sin\\theta)^2&=25\\end{align*}$$\nThe expression is independent of $\\theta$.",
